msgstr "有 %(numberGarrisoned)s 個陸地商人駐守於商船"

msgid "There are %(numberTrading)s land traders trading"
msgstr "有 %(numberTrading)s 個陸地商人正在進行貿易"

msgid "There are %(numberTrading)s merchant ships trading"
msgstr "有 %(numberTrading)s 艘商船正在貿易"

msgid "There are no bribable units"
msgstr "沒有可賄賂的單位"

msgid "There are no land traders."
msgstr "沒有陸地上的商人。"

msgid "There are no merchant ships."
msgstr "沒有商船。"

msgid "There are primarily three ways to select units:\n"
msgstr "選擇單位的方式主要有三種：\n"

msgid "There is %(inactiveString)s."
msgstr "有 %(inactiveString)s。"

msgid "There is %(numberGarrisoned)s land trader garrisoned on a trading merchant ship"
msgstr "有 %(numberGarrisoned)s 個陸地商人駐守於商船"

msgid "There is %(numberTrading)s land trader trading"
msgstr "有 %(numberTrading)s 個陸地商人正在進行貿易"

msgid "There is %(numberTrading)s merchant ship trading"
msgstr "有 %(numberTrading)s 艘商船正在貿易"

msgid "There is no active connection"
msgstr "沒有活躍的連線"

msgid "Therefore select some units, press and hold the right mouse button, draw any line, then release the button."
msgstr "因此選擇一些單位，押著滑鼠右鍵不放來畫一些線，再鬆開按鍵。"

msgid "These entities cannot be controlled."
msgstr "無法控制這些實體。"

msgid "These maps are not playable but for demonstration purposes only."
msgstr "這些地圖僅供展示用途，無法遊玩。"

