msgid "We now have enough resources, but one structure is missing. Although this is an economic tutorial, it is nonetheless useful to be prepared for defense in case of attack, so let's build Barracks.\n"
msgstr "現在我們有足夠的資源，但還缺少一個建築。雖然這只是個經濟教程，不過準備防禦攻擊仍然有用，我們來蓋座軍營吧。\n"

